                                "sense_id": "0e813ef7-18aa-373a-9945-e2a622937e43",
                                "text": "Come and have a drink,' he said, 'and my Christian name is Douglas on this side of the Rye, mind that. Dougal Douglas at Meadows Meade and Douglas Dougal a Willis's, mind. Only a formality for the insurance cards and such.'\n'I better call you Doug, and be done with it.'"
